## 💾 **Data Management**

### **Password Management**
- **Create Passwords**
  - Title, username, password fields
  - URL/website association
  - Custom notes/comments
  - TOTP 2FA seed support
  - Auto-generation with customizable complexity

- **Password Operations**
  - View/edit password details
  - Copy credentials to clipboard
  - Generate new passwords
  - Update existing entries (creates new blockchain version)
  - Delete passwords (marks as deleted on blockchain)

- **TOTP Integration**
  - Generate time-based one-time passwords
  - QR code scanning for 2FA setup
  - Real-time TOTP code display
  - Countdown timer for code expiration

### **Notes Management**
- **Create Notes**
  - Title and content fields
  - Rich text support
  - Unlimited length
  - Encrypted storage on blockchain

- **Note Operations**
  - View/edit note content
  - Search through notes
  - Copy note content
  - Update notes (creates new blockchain version)
  - Delete notes

### **Chat System**
- **Encrypted Messaging**
  - End-to-end encrypted chat between Solana wallets
  - Asymmetric encryption using wallet key pairs
  - Message history stored on blockchain
  - Real-time message synchronization

- **Chat Commands**
  - `//help` - Show available commands
  - `//balance` - Display both wallets' SOL balances
  - `//address` - Show/copy wallet addresses
  - `//sendsol <amount>` - Send SOL to chat recipient
  - `//tran` - Show transaction history between wallets

- **Chat Features**
  - Character count meter (566 byte limit for blockchain memos)
  - Command recognition (commands don't count toward character limit)
  - Message threading by wallet address
  - Automatic message retrieval from blockchain

